<title>SWITZERLAND: CS Group says 1997 Q1 very good.</title>
<headline>CS Group says 1997 Q1 very good.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse Group said the first three months of 1997 were very good, with revenues from balance sheet business, commissions and trading activities significantly higher than the year-ago period.</p>
</text>
